# Goal
sensor_msgs/RegionOfInterest roi
builtin_interfaces/Time stamp
# Normalized horizontal setpoint offset in [-1, 1] for where the target is
# kept in the camera frame instead of dead-center: 0.0 (also the unset
# default) centers it: unchanged, straight-on approach. Positive values bias
# the target toward the right of frame, which curves the approach in from
# the left; negative values do the opposite.
float32 setpoint_offset
---
# Result
bool success
string message
---
# Feedback
string state
